  sequence:
  - background: {fileID: 0}
    clearBackground: 0
    speakerName: Ryuuji
    dialogue:
    - (Yuuchi's playing video games again.)
    - (I don't think I've seen this one before. Taiga must've bought it for him.)
    - (I suppose he deserves to be rewarded for how well he does in school. Neither
      of us really have to worry if he's playing too much.)
    - (He's a lot more disciplined than his sisters, too. I wonder how that happened.)
  alternateSequences:
  - dayOfTheWeek: 0
    sequence:
    - background: {fileID: 0}
      clearBackground: 0
      speakerName: Ryuuji
      dialogue:
      - (Yuuchi's playing video games again.)
      - (I wonder if there's any father-son activities I could sign us up for.)
      - (It could be better than spending the whole weekend just playing games.)
      - (Yuuchi's never been receptive to the idea though...)
